label On Entry
Sienna: The bathroom’s pretty small but it’s not like I’m gonna be hanging out around here.
Sienna: It has what it needs.
Sienna: I’ll have my luxurious bathtub when I’m rich.
Sienna pulls out her phone.
join Item (Phone) center
Sienna: There’s no signal here.
leave Item
Sienna: Let’s continue searching then.
set {bathroom_firsttime} = false
[end_timeline]
label Mirror
Sienna: This mirror…
Sienna: Something about it is odd.
Sienna looks straight in the mirror.
Sienna: Am I still myself?
do QteManager.start_challenge_invisible()
[end_timeline]
label Bloody Clothes
At first glance, the clothes on the floor look bloody.
But it turns out it was just mud.
Sienna: It’s his clothes.
Sienna: I was wearing it earlier when I moved in.
Sienna: But it got a bit dirty from the rain and mud.
Sienna: I changed as soon as we got here.
Sienna: If I was wearing this earlier then…
Sienna stuck her hand inside the pockets and fished out some keys.
audio "res://assets/sounds/sfx/key_collect.mp3"
Sienna: Bingo.
Sienna: The keys to all rooms in the apartment.
Sienna: I’ll leave you on the floor for now.
Ghost: I guess this is all I am to you.
Ghost: Just some clothes to drop once you’ve had enough.
set {rooms_unlocked} = true
[end_timeline]